Package: Tolwardski_AmericasPastimeProject
Title: Player-Level Walk Rate and Slugging Time Series from MLB Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Ward", "Family", , , role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads MLB game-by-game play-by-play data via the
    'baseballr' package, caches it locally, and pre-processes it into
    player-game level statistics (plate appearances, at-bats, walks,
    total bases). Provides rolling-window functions to compute
    time-evolving walk rate and slugging percentage per player within a
    season, in support of exploratory analysis of the relationship
    between plate discipline and power hitting.
